.TH LIBMPQ__UPDATE_COMMIT 3 2026-09-25 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__update_commit \- publish a staged MPQ update
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__update_commit(mpq_update_s *update);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates and atomically publishes the private working copy over the original filesystem file. Immediately before publication, libmpq performs a best-effort identity recheck. This is not a lock or a conditional replacement primitive. The handle is consumed on both success and failure; do not use it again. A no-op transaction preserves the complete original container byte-for-byte.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \fBLIBMPQ_SUCCESS\fP on success, or a negative libmpq error.
.SH ERRORS
A failure before publication leaves the original file untouched. A negative LIBMPQ_ERROR_* result may report identity conflict, validation, flush, close, or publication failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__update_begin (3),
.BR libmpq__update_abort (3)
